{"blocks": [{"bbox": [0.0, 0.0, 612.0, 792.0], "text": "", "type": "Page"}, {"bbox": [300.62109375, 39.05859375, 308.7039794921875, 48.70477294921875], "text": "", "type": "PageHeader"}, {"bbox": [258.77001953125, 67.78472900390625, 353.18902587890625, 76.78472900390625], "text": "", "type": "PageHeader"}, {"bbox": [66.041015625, 97.453125, 537.9656372070312, 140.97265625], "text": "10, 2017 and a Pew Research Center analysis of U.S. Census Bureau data. The survey, conducted online in English and in Spanish, included an oversample of employed adults working in science, technology, engineering and math fields. See Methodology for details.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [65.7421875, 160.875, 544.2939453125, 188.919677734375], "text": "Most women in STEM jobs who work in majority-male workplaces, in computer jobs or who have a postgraduate degree have experienced gender discrimination at work", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [65.7421875, 197.2265625, 212.4180908203125, 643.0125885009766], "text": "On average, women working in STEM jobs are more likely than men to say they have experienced workplace discrimination due to their gender. Half (50%) of women in STEM jobs say they have experienced any of eight forms of discrimination in the workplace because of their gender \u2013 more than women in non-STEM jobs (41%) and far more than men in STEM occupations (19%). The most common forms of gender discrimination experienced by women in STEM jobs include earning less than a man doing the same job (29%), having someone treat them as if they were not competent (29%), experiencing repeated, small slights in their workplace (20%) and receiving less support from senior leaders than a man who was doing the same job (18%).", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [231.591796875, 216.80438232421875, 505.1932067871094, 244.76434326171875], "text": "Half of women in STEM jobs say they have been discriminated against at work", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [229.201171875, 250.98046875, 532.9290161132812, 272.97222900390625], "text": "% of those in science, technology, engineering and math jobs who say they have ever experienced the following at work due to their gender", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [225.13433410644532, 276.9404856872559, 548.5103802490235, 547.9718830871582], "text": "Ever experienced any of these Men in STEM jobs Women in STEM jobs Women in non-STEM jobs types of discrimination at work 19% 50% 41% Earned less than a woman/ man doing the same job 6 29 24 Were treated as if they were not competent 4 29 22 Experienced repeated, small slights at work 4 20 16 Received less support from senior leaders than a woman/man doing same job 9 18 15 Felt isolated in their workplace 5 11 8 Been passed over for the most important assignments 4 9 10 Been turned down for a job 4 7 7 Been denied a promotion 4 6 7 0 20 40 60 80 100", "type": "Table"}, {"bbox": [228.05770446777345, 277.2048899841309, 363.0068011474609, 313.1142985534668], "text": "Ever experienced any of these", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [362.6315036010742, 277.2048899841309, 422.0075259399414, 313.1142985534668], "text": "Men in STEM jobs", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [422.1260409545898, 277.2048899841309, 501.25456573486326, 313.1142985534668], "text": "Women in STEM jobs", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [501.25456573486326, 277.2048899841309, 547.2778964233398, 313.1142985534668], "text": "Women in non-STEM jobs", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [228.05770446777345, 312.99449035644534, 363.0068011474609, 329.2636172485352], "text": "types of discrimination at work", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [362.6315036010742, 312.99449035644534, 422.0075259399414, 329.2636172485352], "text": "19%", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [422.1260409545898, 312.99449035644534, 501.25456573486326, 329.2636172485352], "text": "50%", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [501.25456573486326, 312.99449035644534, 547.2778964233398, 329.2636172485352], "text": "41%", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [228.05770446777345, 329.32558700561526, 363.0068011474609, 355.832117767334], "text": "Earned less than a woman/ man doing the same job", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [362.6315036010742, 329.32558700561526, 422.0075259399414, 355.832117767334], "text": "6", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [422.1260409545898, 329.32558700561526, 501.25456573486326, 355.832117767334], "text": "29", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [501.25456573486326, 329.32558700561526, 547.2581439208984, 355.832117767334], "text": "24", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [228.05770446777345, 356.03042098999026, 363.0068011474609, 381.214930267334], "text": "Were treated as if they were not competent", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [362.6315036010742, 356.03042098999026, 422.0075259399414, 381.214930267334], "text": "4", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [422.1260409545898, 356.03042098999026, 501.25456573486326, 381.214930267334], "text": "29", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [501.25456573486326, 356.03042098999026, 547.1001239013672, 381.214930267334], "text": "22", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [228.05770446777345, 381.0414149475098, 363.0068011474609, 405.9119441223145], "text": "Experienced repeated, small slights at work", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [362.6315036010742, 381.0414149475098, 422.0075259399414, 405.9119441223145], "text": "4 20", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [422.1260409545898, 381.0414149475098, 501.25456573486326, 405.9119441223145], "text": "", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [501.25456573486326, 381.0414149475098, 547.0211138916015, 405.9119441223145], "text": "16", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [228.05770446777345, 405.9697825622559, 363.0068011474609, 434.2610423278809], "text": "Received less support from senior leaders than a woman/man doing same job", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [362.6315036010742, 405.9697825622559, 422.0075259399414, 434.2610423278809], "text": "9 18", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [422.1260409545898, 405.9697825622559, 501.25456573486326, 434.2610423278809], "text":